Error [jet.BindingGenerationFailed]: Could not generate bindings from `{work}/broken.ps1`.
 Why: `pwsh` rejected the PowerShell binding input: the script has a PowerShell parse error.
 Fix: Define named PowerShell functions with Jet-compatible identifiers and rerun `jet inspect bind pwsh` inside the provisioned Jet environment.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E3208
